From 942fb6de971a253cbeab96a889101ea83b739d84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ticlext-Altihaf <hi@ticlext.top>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 04:01:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] feat(compute-providers): bootstrap the Lizard worker and
 expose Lizard in setup

Install the Roomote worker into fresh and forked Lizard microVMs, dispatch
task runs to them from the controller, and surface Lizard in the settings,
onboarding, and docs surfaces.

Lizard ships no custom-template upload flow, so the worker is installed at
boot: the release archive and the shipped install script are uploaded through
the filesystem API and executed once the sandbox is running. Snapshot forks
reinstall the worker so the sandbox matches the current runtime protocol;
standby resumes reuse the existing install.
